<title>ITALY: Brembo first-half 1996 profits fall.</title>
<headline>Brembo first-half 1996 profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Consolidated results</p>
<p>    Turnover				190.175 vs 185.668</p>
<p>    Profit before interest and tax   25.705 vs  34.658</p>
<p>    Cash flow				34.001 vs  34.107</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	     39.530 vs  44.653</p>
<p>    Operating margin		     26.584 vs  34.830</p>
<p>Parent company results</p>
<p>    Turnover				179.243 vs  179.386</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  18.050 vs   23.123</p>
<p>NOTE - Italian vehicle braking components group Brembo said it expected that its second half 1996 results would match those seen in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
